 "intro_zh": "景区以丘陵地貌为主，主要景点和设施有果园、山水瀑布、茶田、望茶亭、茶情阁、茶艺馆、茶花大观园、美食街、生态谷、人工湖、游客中心、会议中心、围龙食府、山庄别墅等，彰显出博大精深的茶文化和客家文化主题。",
 "intro_en": "Meizhou (Chinese: 梅州, Hakka Chinese: Mòichû) is a prefecture-level city in eastern Guangdong province, China. It has an area of 15,864.51 km2 (6,125.32 sq mi), and a population of 3,873,239 as of the 2020 census. It comprises Meijiang District, Meixian District, Xingning City and five counties. Its built-up or metro area made up of two urban districts was home to 992,351 inhabitants.",
